// # 29. What is a getter?

// A getter is executed when the property is read.

// ```js
// get name() {
//     return this.firstName;
// }
// ```

// So:

// ```js
// user.name
// ```

// runs the getter.

// ---

// # 30. What is a setter?

// A setter is executed when a value is assigned to the property.

// ```js
// set name(value) {
//     this.firstName = value;
// }
// ```

// Then:

// ```js
// user.name = "Rahul";
// ```

// runs the setter.

// ---

