// # 47. Why is property lookup important?

// When you do:

// ```js
// obj.x
// ```

// a simplified mental model is:

// ```text
// evaluate obj
// ↓
// check own property x
// ↓
// if found → use it
// ↓
// otherwise check prototype
// ↓
// continue prototype chain
// ↓
// if nowhere → undefined
// ```

// If `x` is an accessor property, lookup can also invoke its getter.

